{"ID":"20230925154834-r2ri7fh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154834-r2ri7fh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154834-r2ri7fh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154838-bveyy4k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154839-wqhqcd4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154839-wqhqcd4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【枳实白术汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154839"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154838-bveyy4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154838-bveyy4k","updated":"20230925154838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：枳实七枚、白术二两"}]},{"ID":"20230925154838-ysi22yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154838-ysi22yg","updated":"20230925154838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右二味，以水五升，煮取三升，去滓，分温三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154838-n3bguvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154838-n3bguvt","updated":"20230925154838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【14.76】水饮，心下坚，大如盘，边如旋杯，枳实白术汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154838-hs1tzva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154838-hs1tzva","updated":"20230925154838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（跟甘遂半夏汤交替用抽水力量会强一点；甘遂半夏汤服了人会被打得虚一些，枳术汤则倾向调理）"}]},{"ID":"20230925154839-wqhqcd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154839-wqhqcd4"}}]}